@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:唔……怎么办呢……|#0101Bad08_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，有什么在意的地方吗？|#0101Bad08_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。不过我也觉得这里没什么线索了，只不过……<br>这说不定，只是我的错觉……|#0101Bad08_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对艾玛言辞闪烁的回答，雪莉不禁感到疑问。|#0101Bad08_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么回事？|#0101Bad08_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，我说了你别笑我哦？<br>其实进来这里之后，我就一直觉得——|#0101Bad08_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛、雪莉，<br>我们准备去其他地方调查了。|#0101Bad08_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵，希望你们能找到线索哦。|#0101Bad08_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，嗯，好……|#0101Bad08_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅、玛格、米莉亚三人<br>离开了淋浴房。|#0101Bad08_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们前脚刚走，<br>汉娜后脚就回来了。|#0101Bad08_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜，你没事吧！？|#0101Bad08_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……没事哦？一点都没事。<br>所以，你们有找到什么线索吗？|#0101Bad08_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:现在还没有……<br>不过，艾玛说她有些在意的地方。|#0101Bad08_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，嗯……<br>所以，你们听了真的别取笑我哦？我说……|#0101Bad08_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:向雪莉和汉娜再次强调后，<br>艾玛怯怯说道。|#0101Bad08_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_21_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:你们不感觉，从进来这里之后<br>就一直有人在盯着我们吗……？|#0101Bad08_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜和雪莉对视了一下，<br>然后转头面向艾玛，同时摇了摇头。|#0101Bad08_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:唔，我没感觉呢。|#0101Bad08_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也是，完全没感觉。|#0101Bad08_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:是吗……<br>到底是我的错觉吗……|#0101Bad08_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:三人开始环视整个淋浴房。|#0101Bad08_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:难不成，有某处设置了<br>摄像头……？|#0101Bad08_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:呃！？如果是真的话，那也太差劲了！|#0101Bad08_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和汉娜开始四处认真搜索，<br>艾玛也开始认真调查周边——|#0101Bad08_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_181 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:此时，忽然响起少女的笑声。|#0101Bad08_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……！？刚刚的声音是怎么回事……|#0101Bad08_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

