@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:唔……刚刚的声音<br>会不会是手机掉下来的声音呢？|#0101Bad08_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

