[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀？开不了机呢……|#0101Bad08_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:手机似乎是掉下来的时候摔坏了。|#0101Bad08_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

