[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉！汉娜！<br>我在这里！求你们快注意到我！！|#0101Bad08_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛向【镜子另一侧】的<br>雪莉和汉娜大声呼救。<br>但是，她的声音传不到两人的耳中。|#0101Bad08_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎、怎么一回事……？<br>这里难道是镜子里面的世界……？|#0101Bad08_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和汉娜在镜子另一侧的淋浴房<br>搜索着暗门。|#0101Bad08_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而当艾玛看见在她们背后出现的人影时，<br>不禁发出了疑惑的声音。|#0101Bad08_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:假、假的吧……怎么会！？|#0101Bad08_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，艾玛？<br>真是的，你跑哪里去了？|#0101Bad08_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你突然不见，<br>吓了我们一跳！|#0101Bad08_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

