[PrintTextModified Text:啊，对了。这里掉了一部手机，<br>是不是艾玛你的？|#0101Bad08_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和汉娜，准备和有着艾玛外貌的【那个东西】<br>离开淋浴房。|#0101Bad08_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你们两个等一下！那个不是我！<br>我在这里！|#0101Bad08_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的诉说不过是徒劳，三人离开了镜子前。|#0101Bad08_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

